        "created_at": "2016-01-21T16:59:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There are also individual play areas - illustrated well by how it’s harder for Chokepoint to steal most Links than other kinds of equipment. When destroyed, many Links leave the villain or environment play area, not a hero play area, so Kinetic Looter can’t grab them.</p>",
