      {
        "id": 153753,
        "name": "Trajector",
        "username": "Trajector",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-21T19:55:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Except Kinetic Looter says nothing about the hero play area, it just says “leaves play”</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Err…right then, not Kinetic Looter - the other one. Chokepoint definitely had some card that destroyed equipment and referred to cards leaving the hero play area while I had a Cortex Hyperstimulator in front of her.</p>",
