      {
        "id": 153755,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-21T21:51:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The mental gymnastics required to interact with one-shots are amazing.</p><p>They enter play, but are not in play after they enter play, nor do they leave play.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Basically we have a ruling that card effects will never count One-Shot cards as cards in play. &nbsp;</p><p>Because that makes a lot more sense than saying that One Shot cards that enter play never enter play.</p>",
